# Corpses of the Lost: "When this enchantment enters, create a 2/2 black Skeleton Pirate creature token" and "Skeletons you
# control get +1/+0 and have haste." Turn 1 Bot1 casts an Ornithopter (free) and Corpses of the Lost (Mox Jet, Mox Ruby, Mox
# Pearl). The token is a 3/2 with haste and attacks at once; the Ornithopter, not a Skeleton, is still a 0/2 flier with no
# haste and can't attack (the refusal, with the Skeleton Pirate attacking as its positive control). Bot2 loses 3.

